      "file_path": "TODO.md",
      "height": 80,
      "id": "e1fd4cd1505a6624",
      "line_num": 59,
      "source": "todo_md",
      "tags": [],
      "text": "**Reviewer T's bottom-of-page cutoff \u2014 reproduced on 3.0.0, fixed by migrating the surface (2026-08-03): the try.sage welcome page pinned a `--pos:fixed` 100vh layer and flex-centered its overflow \u2014 behind mobile browser chrome and off both scroll ends. Rebuilt as a server-rendered no-build page (`pages/try_sage_panel.py` + `try-sage.html`, 4.6 KB first response): normal document flow, `100dvh`, safe-area inset, overflow-safe `margin:auto` centering. `TrySageWelcome.svelte` deleted; anonymous `/` answers server-side when `ENABLE_TRY_SAGE` is on, other deploys untouched (routes not registered). Guard-rail `try-sage-welcome.cy.ts` asserts phone-viewport scroll + flag-off inertness; `ENABLE_TRY_SAGE` passthrough added to the e2e + manual-check harnesses.**\n- [x] **[WE]** reproduce on try.sage.is @ 3.0.0 (Alexander confirmed), rebuild surface, render-verify in container\n- [x] **[WE]** gates green 2026-08-03 on the fresh `it_build`: full flag-off suite 208 tests/168 passing/0 failing (4m18s); flag-on `try-sage-welcome.cy.ts` 3/3 (anonymous first-response, phone scroll + footer reachable, signed-in SPA)\n- [ ] **[MANUALLY]** (Alexander) commit, cut 3.0.1 via `release_and_push_GHCR`, digest-pinned CapRover deploy, then phone-check try.sage.is\n\n`TODO.md:L59`",
