      "source": "todo_md",
      "tags": [],
      "text": "**Knowledge upload `'NoneType' object is not iterable` \u2014 root cause shipped fixed in the 2.3.3 diagnostics work; verified in code 2026-08-03: all three `generate_*_batch_embeddings` now raise `EndpointUnreachable` instead of swallowing to `None` ([retrieval/utils.py:849](app/backend/sage_is_ai/retrieval/utils.py#L849), [906](app/backend/sage_is_ai/retrieval/utils.py#L906), [969](app/backend/sage_is_ai/retrieval/utils.py#L969)); a FastAPI handler maps it to a structured 503 ([main.py:1524](app/backend/sage_is_ai/main.py#L1524)); boot probes light `/admin/diagnostics` before the first upload fails (`diagnostics/boot.py`). Hit on sage.startr.cloud 2026-06-05 @ 2.3.2; try.sage.is never reproduced it on the identical image. (Surfaced by Alexander.)**\n`TODO.md:L602`",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 280,
